/* 1.5.6 (Discussion #216): DEEP TIGHT PERC (9..11), kits put together from the five's pieces (drum_voice.c DV_KIT),
 * appended. Firmware before 1.5.6 clamps 9..11 to 8 (77) when it loads them (param_fit) */
